    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Behavioral pattern</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Tier 3</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Memento</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Take a snapshot of an object's state and put it back later, without letting anyone else peek inside. Build undo/redo for a text editor (Memento plus Command), game save slots and an all-or-nothing routing-table commit; then learn what snapshots cost and when deltas or commands are the better choice.</p>\n  <p class=\"small prereq\"><b>Before this page:</b> <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-oop-interfaces\">Interfaces</a> (program to an interface), <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-oop-polymorphism\">Polymorphism</a> (one call, many bodies), and <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-uml-class\">UML class diagrams</a> for the notation in the Structure picture (arrows and diamonds: <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-uml-relationships\">relationships</a>).</p>\n"
  },
